- Secrets do not appear in client bundles or ordinary application responses.

Use real browser-based end-to-end testing if the necessary framework and runtime are available. Otherwise, implement the strongest feasible automated coverage and clearly report what could not be tested.

Do not claim that a test passed merely because the test file exists.

