After implementation, provide a concise but evidence-based report containing:

1. Repository and architecture findings.
2. Files and modules materially changed.
3. Technical SEO features implemented.
4. Sitemap and robots behavior verified.
5. Article lifecycle and indexing rules.
6. Structured-data validation results.
7. AdSense configuration and policy-readiness findings.
